Lumina Protocol
Title: Lumina Protocol: Living Bounties Evaluated by AI Category: Projects & Milestones Description: Lumina Protocol replaces traditional one-and-done bounties with "Living Bounties". Built on a React/Vite frontend and a Python Intelligent Contract running on the GenVM, the protocol periodically evaluates open-source contributions over time. GenLayer validators dynamically crawl the web to review GitHub activity and documentation as evidence. Using gl.eq_principle.prompt_comparative, the LLM validators reach consensus on the ongoing real-world impact of the project to dispense continuous, dynamic rewards from a sponsored reserve pool.

